  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_001 (pca_n2000 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, avgpool/concat) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.6287). This experiment tests replacing pca_n2000 with scgpt (a more advanced RNA encoder) while keeping other components identical. This clarifies whether the RNA encoder is a key factor in performance. scgpt is likely more powerful but may increase cost slightly (estimated ~5-6 GPU hours). This balances exploration of a critical design choice with cost efficiency."
